    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You are skilled in making and handling impromptu <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Explosives\" title=\"Explosives\">Explosives</a>. You gain a +5 bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> checks to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Handle_Explosives\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Handle Explosives\">Handle Explosives</a>. In addition, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a> to craft the equivalent of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Frag_Grenade\" title=\"Frag Grenade\">Frag Grenade</a> from spare parts you have on hand. You must have access to the appropriate supplies, such as an old blaster, a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Tool_Kit\" title=\"Tool Kit\">Tool Kit</a>, or materials found inside a hangar bay.",
